AUDIO: 'complications? Well, you can have all sorts of the longer something runs, the more likely there\'s going to be some kind of infrastructure blip that\'s going to cause a problem in that long-running task. So, you could have network blips,'

[05:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
