AUDIO: 'It has working. It can go into an input required. From input required, it can go back to working, and then eventually it\'ll complete or be canceled or fail. So, that\'s one of the things that\'s super'

[11:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'interesting about the task specification is that it\'s about the life cycle of the task. There\'s a whole bunch of other semantics there as well around obtaining inputs and delivering results. And I\'m'

